`benchmark.meta description: Inline Bitmap bit writes and reads matching the raw integer workload.
`benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: allocator

/core/bitmap

. checksum U64
for round in 0 .. < 10000
    . bits = Bitmap'U64()
    for index in 0 .. < 64
        bits[index] = true
    for index in 0 .. < 64
        if bits[index]
            checksum += 1
    bits = bits.fill(false)
    if bits[0]
        checksum += 1

-- "bench-result allocation/bitmap-inline checksum=$checksum"
